    {
      "aliases": [
        "NEW_EGYPT14_INTRO"
      ],
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "We've arrived at another fixed point on the timeline.",
              "zh": "我们遇到了时间线上的另一个确切节点。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "You must win using an array of specific Card Decks",
              "zh": "你必须用一种选定好的卡组取得胜利。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "How is this different from the last one we ran into?",
              "zh": "和上次我们遇到的有什么不同？"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "At least... we have some choices this time.",
              "zh": "至少……我们有得选。"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "aliases": [
        "NEW_EGYPT14_OUTRO"
      ],
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "What do the diamond icons on those Challenging Card Decks mean?",
              "zh": "那些挑战卡组上的钻石标记是什么意思？"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "They represent difficulty and rewards.",
              "zh": "代表了难度与奖励。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "The higher the difficulty, the better the rewards.",
              "zh": "难度越高，奖励也就越丰厚。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Can we find Challenging Card Decks like these in other levels?",
              "zh": "在别的关卡也能找到这样的挑战卡组吗？"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Of course.",
              "zh": "当然可以。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "As long as we can choose plants",
              "zh": "只要能选择植物。"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
